    percent_returned = (returned_count / total) * 100

    result = (
        f"Returned orders: {returned_count:,} out of {total:,} "
        f"({percent_returned:.2f}% of all orders)."
    )
    return (result, None)
```
This returns a clear percentage of orders that were marked as returned.

